la realizaci\u00f3n de tareas en cualquier lugar. Todo lo que ofrece el Vivobook 15 es atrevido y mejorado, desde su procesador Intel Core de 12.\u00aa generaci\u00f3n hasta su pantalla n\u00edtida y clara.<br><\/div><div><br><\/div><h2><span style='background-color: initial;'>Especificaciones<\/span><\/h2><ul>\t<li>CPU: Intel Core i3-1215U (6 N\u00facleos, 8MB Cach\u00e9, hasta 4GHz, 64-bit)<\/li>\t<li>RAM: 8GB DDR4-SDRAM&nbsp;(No ampliable)<\/li>\t<li>Almacenamiento: SSD 512GB M.2 NVMe PCIe 3.0<\/li>\t<li>Gr\u00e1fica: Intel UHD<\/li>\t<li>Pantalla: 15.6' (39,6cm)&nbsp;FULL HD (1920x1080) 16:9 \/ 220nits \/ AntiGlare \/ NTSC:45% \/ 60Hz<\/li>\t<li>Comunicaciones: Wi-Fi 6: S\u00ed, 802.11ax (2x2) \/ Bluetooth 5.3<\/li>\t<li>Webcam HD S\u00ed (Con filtro de privacidad)<\/li>\t<li>Conexiones:<\/li><ul>\t<li>1 x USB 2.0 Tipo A<\/li>\t<li>1 x USB 3.2 (Gen 1) Tipo C<\/li>\t<li>2 x USB 3.2 (Gen 1) Tipo A<\/li>\t<li>1 x HDMI 1.4<\/li>\t<li>1 x DC-in<\/li>\t<li>1 x Jack 3,5mm (Auriculares + Micr\u00f3fono)<\/li><\/ul>\t<li>Sistema Operativo: Windows 11 Pro<\/li>\t<li>Dimensiones: 359 x 232 x 19,9 mm<\/li>\t<li>TouchPad: Panel Multit\u00e1ctil<\/li>\t<li>Bater\u00eda: 42Wh, 3 Celdas, Iones de Litio<\/li>\t<li>Peso : 1,7 Kg<\/li>\t<li>Color: Azul Tranquilo<\/li><\/ul>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ASUS","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":2.33,"unit_price":374,"unit_price_tax":374,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","sub_category":"Portatiles","quantity":5,"brand":"ASUS","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_asu-p%20p1502cza-ej1728x_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":369}}},"0197961121582":{"result":false,"need_alert":false,"report":{"notes":{"product":