CDW, HL-L8240CDW, HL-L3220CW, HL-L3240CDW, DCP-L3520CDW, DCP-L3560CDW, MFC-L3740CDW, MFC-L8390CDW.<br><\/p>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_bro-tn248bk_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"38.73","unit_price_tax":43.73},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["4977766814034"],"reference":"TN248BK","name":{"1":"T\u00f3ner Original Brother TN248BK\/ Negro","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<p><h2>TN-248BK<\/h2>T\u00f3ner Negro Duraci\u00f3n estimada: 1.000 p\u00e1ginas seg\u00fan ISO\/IEC 19798<br><br>Con el t\u00f3ner original negro TN248BK, de duraci\u00f3n est\u00e1ndar de 1.000 p\u00e1ginas, tendr\u00e1s impresiones a color de alta calidad. Con el sistema de consumibles independientes, 4 cartuchos de t\u00f3ner y tambor, solamente tendr\u00e1s que cambiar el consumible que se haya agotado. Adem\u00e1s, disfruta de una gesti\u00f3n m\u00e1s eficiente del t\u00f3ner con la funci\u00f3n ahorro de t\u00f3ner y el modo bk, que permite seguir trabajando en monocromo si se agota alguno de los t\u00f3neres de color, hasta que se agote el t\u00f3ner negro.<br><br>Impresoras compatibles: MFC-L3760CDW, MFC-L8340CDW, HL-L8230CDW, HL-L8240CDW, HL-L3220CW, HL-L3240CDW, DCP-L3520CDW, DCP-L3560CDW, MFC-L3740CDW, MFC-L8390CDW.<br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"BROTHER","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.63,"unit_price":43.73,"unit_price_tax":43.73,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Toner Original","sub_category":"Toner Brother","quantity":0,"brand":"BROTHER","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_bro-tn248bk_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":38.73}}},"4977766830294":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":